  "title": "Slow Cooker Jambalaya (Vegan)",
  "description": "This slow-cooker jambalaya (vegan) recipe uses seitan, vegan sausage, celery, onion, bell pepper, and Cajun seasoning for an easy weeknight jambalaya.",
